 while we prepare dependencies on your machine.\nCloud Code maintains and uses a suite of best-in-class Cloud Native devtools on your machine including [Cloud SDK](https://cloud.google.com/sdk), [Kubectl](https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/kubectl/kubectl/), [Minikube](https://minikube.sigs.k8s.io/docs/), and [Skaffold](https://skaffold.dev/)."},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.kubernetes.localDevExplorer","when":"gcloudComponentsInstalling","contents":"Welcome to Cloud Code! Please wait while we prepare dependencies on your machine.\nCloud Code maintains and uses a suite of best-in-class Cloud Native devtools on your machine including [Cloud SDK](https://cloud.google.com/sdk), [Kubectl](https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/kubectl/kubectl/), [Minikube](https://minikube.sigs.k8s.io/docs/), and [Skaffold](https://skaffold.dev/)."},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.cloudRunExplorer","when":"!gcloudInstalling && !authLoggedIn","contents":"Please login to Google Cloud to continue. If you don't have an account yet, you can get started with a [free trial](https://cloud.google.com/free).\n[Login to Google Cloud](command:cloudcode.gke.runGcloudAuth)"},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.secretsExplorer","when":"!gcloudInstalling && !authLoggedIn","contents":"Please login to Google Cloud to continue. If you don't have an account yet, you can get started with a [free trial](https://cloud.google.com/free).\n[Login to Google Cloud](command:cloudcode.gke.runGcloudAuth)"},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.gceExplorer","when":"!gcloudInstalling && !authLoggedIn","contents":"Please login to Google Cloud to continue. If you don't have an account yet, you can get started with a [free trial](https://cloud.google.com/free).\n[Login to Google Cloud](command:cloudcode.gke.runGcloudAuth)"},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.dataprocExplorer","when":"!gcloudInstalling && !authLoggedIn","contents":"Please login to Google Cloud to continue. If you don't have an account yet, you can get started with a [free trial](https://cloud.google.com/free).\n[Login to Google Cloud](command:cloudcode.gke.runGcloudAuth)"},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.bigQueryDatasetExplorer","when":"!gcloudInstalling && !authLoggedIn","contents":"Please login to Google Cloud to continue. If you don't have an account yet, you can get started with a [free trial](https://cloud.google.com/free).\n[Login to Google Cloud](command:cloudcode.gke.runGcloudAuth)"},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.gcsExplorer","when":"!gcloudInstalling && !authLoggedIn","contents":"Please login to Google Cloud to continue. If you don't have an account yet, you can get started with a [free trial](https://cloud.google.com/free).\n[Login to Google Cloud](command:cloudcode.gke.runGcloudAuth)"},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.cloudRunExplorer","when":"authLoggedIn && !authProjectId","contents":"Please select a Google Cloud project continue. If you don't have a project yet, you can create one in [Cloud Console](https://console.cloud.google.com/projectcreate).\n[Select a project](command:cloudcode.sharedExplorer.chooseProject)"},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.secretsExplorer","when":"authLoggedIn && !authProjectId","contents":"Please select a Google Cloud project continue. If you don't have a project yet, you can create one in [Cloud Console](https://console.cloud.google.com/projectcreate).\n[Select a project](command:cloudcode.sharedExplorer.chooseProject)"},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.gceExplorer","when":"authLoggedIn && !authProjectId","contents":"Please select a Google Cloud project continue. If you don't have a project yet, you can create one in [Cloud Console](https://console.cloud.google.com/projectcreate).\n[Select a project](command:cloudcode.sharedExplorer.chooseProject)"},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.cloudRunExplorer","when":"authLoggedIn && !authProjectId && !runningOnCloudShell","contents":"If you want to select a project in another account, you can [sign out](command:cloudcode.gke.gcloudSignout) and sign back in."},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.secretsExplorer","when":"authLoggedIn && !authProjectId && !runningOnCloudShell","contents":"If you want to select a project in another account, you can [sign out](command:cloudcode.gke.gcloudSignout) and sign back in."},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.gceExplorer","when":"authLoggedIn && !authProjectId && !runningOnCloudShell","contents":"If you want to select a project in another account, you can [sign out](command:cloudcode.gke.gcloudSignout) and sign back in."},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.dataprocExplorer","when":"authLoggedIn && authProjectId && dataprocExplorerNeedsApiEnable","contents":"In order to use Cloud Dataproc on Google Cloud, you need to enable the [Cloud Dataproc API](https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/dataproc.googleapis.com).\nConsuming Google Cloud APIs may incur additional billing charges. You can learn more by clicking the above link.\n[Enable Cloud Dataproc API](command:cloudcode.dataprocExplorer.enableApi)\nAlternatively, you can [switch projects](command:cloudcode.sharedExplorer.chooseProject) to a project that already has this API enabled."},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.bigQueryDatasetExplorer","when":"authLoggedIn && authProjectId && dataplexExplorerNeedsApiEnable","contents":"In order to use Cloud Dataplex on Google Cloud, you need to enable the [Cloud Dataplex API](https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/dataplex.googleapis.com).\nConsuming Google Cloud APIs may incur additional billing charges. You can learn more by clicking the above link.\n[Enable Cloud Dataplex API](command:cloudcode.dataplexExplorer.enableApi)\nAlternatively, you can [switch projects](command:cloudcode.sharedExplorer.chooseProject) to a project that already has this API enabled."},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.cloudRunExplorer","when":"authLoggedIn && authProjectId && runExplorerNeedsApiEnable","contents":"In order to use Cloud Run on Google Cloud, you need to enable the [Cloud Run API](https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/run.googleapis.com).\nConsuming Google Cloud APIs may incur additional billing charges. You can learn more by clicking the above link.\n[Enable Cloud Run API](command:cloudcode.runExplorer.enableApi)\nAlternatively, you can [switch projects](command:cloudcode.sharedExplorer.chooseProject) to a project that already has this API enabled."},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.secretsExplorer","when":"authLoggedIn && authProjectId && secretmanagerExplorerNeedsApiEnable","contents":"In order to use Secret Manager on Google Cloud, you need to enable the [Secret Manager API](https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/secretmanager.googleapis.com).\nConsuming Google Cloud APIs may incur additional billing charges. You can learn more by clicking the above link.\n[Enable Secret Manager API](command:cloudcode.secretmanagerExplorer.enableApi)\nAlternatively, you can [switch projects](command:cloudcode.sharedExplorer.chooseProject) to a project that already has this API enabled."},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.gceExplorer","when":"authLoggedIn && authProjectId && computeExplorerNeedsApiEnable","contents":"In order to use Compute Engine on Google Cloud, you need to enable the [Compute API](https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/compute.googleapis.com).\nConsuming Google Cloud APIs may incur additional billing charges. You can learn more by clicking the above link.\n[Enable Compute API](command:cloudcode.computeExplorer.enableApi)\nAlternatively, you can [switch projects](command:cloudcode.sharedExplorer.chooseProject) to a project that already has this API enabled."},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.gcfExplorer","when":"authLoggedIn && authProjectId && cloudfunctionsExplorerNeedsApiEnable","contents":"In order to use Cloud Functions on Google Cloud, you need to enable the [Cloud Functions API](https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/cloudfunctions.googleapis.com) and [Cloud Build API](https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/cloudbuild.googleapis.com).\nConsuming Google Cloud APIs may incur additional billing charges. You can learn more by clicking the above link.\n[Enable Cloud Function and dependent APIs](command:cloudcode.functions.enableApi)\nAlternatively, you can [switch projects](command:cloudcode.sharedExplorer.chooseProject) to a project that already has these APIs enabled."},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.cloudStorageExplorer","when":"authLoggedIn && authProjectId && storageExplorerNeedsApiEnable","contents":"In order to use Cloud Storage on Google Cloud, you need to enable the [Cloud Storage API](https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/storage.googleapis.com).\nConsuming Google Cloud APIs may incur additional billing charges. You can learn more by clicking the above link.\n[Enable Cloud Storage API](command:cloudcode.cloudStorageExplorer.enableApi)\nAlternatively, you can [switch projects](command:cloudcode.sharedExplorer.chooseProject) to a project that already has this API enabled."},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.gcfExplorer","when":"gcloudInstalling","contents":"Welcome to Cloud Code! Please wait while we prepare dependencies on your machine.\nCloud Code maintains and uses a suite of best-in-class Cloud Native devtools on your machine including [Cloud SDK](https://cloud.google.com/sdk), [Kubectl](https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/kubectl/kubectl/), [Minikube](https://minikube.sigs.k8s.io/docs/), and [Skaffold](https://skaffold.dev/)."},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.gcfExplorer","when":"!gcloudInstalling && !authLoggedIn","contents":"Please login to Google Cloud to continue. If you don't have an account yet, you can get started with a [free trial](https://cloud.google.com/free).\n[Login to Google Cloud](command:cloudcode.gke.runGcloudAuth)"},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.gcfExplorer","when":"authLoggedIn && !authProjectId && !remoteCloudFunctionsAvailable && !validFunctionsWorkspace","contents":"You can select a project to work with Cloud Functions.\n[Select a project](command:cloudcode.sharedExplorer.chooseProject)\nYou can [create a function](command:cloudcode.functions.create) or [open a function workspace](command:cloudcode.functions.openWorkspace) locally.\nIf you have already opened a function, [set this workspace as a function workspace.](command:cloudcode.functions.annotateWorkspace)\n[Create function](command:cloudcode.functions.create)"},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.gcfExplorer","when":"authLoggedIn && !authProjectId && !runningOnCloudShell","contents":"If you want to select a project in another account, you can [sign out](command:cloudcode.gke.gcloudSignout) and sign back in."},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.gcfExplorer","when":"authLoggedIn && authProjectId && !remoteCloudFunctionsAvailable && !validFunctionsWorkspace","contents":"We did not find any functions under the current project. [Select a different project](command:cloudcode.sharedExplorer.chooseProject)\nYou can [create a function](command:cloudcode.functions.create) or [open a function workspace](command:cloudcode.functions.openWorkspace) locally.\nIf you have already opened a function, [set this workspace as a function workspace.](command:cloudcode.functions.annotateWorkspace)\n[Create function](command:cloudcode.functions.create)"},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.notebookExplorer","when":"!gcloudInstalling && !authLoggedIn","contents":"Please login to Google Cloud to continue. If you don't have an account yet, you can get started with a [free trial](https://cloud.google.com/free).\n[Login to Google Cloud](command:cloudcode.gke.runGcloudAuth)"},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.cloudStorageExplorer","when":"gcloudInstalling","contents":"Welcome to Cloud Code! Please wait while we prepare dependencies on your machine.\nCloud Code maintains and uses a suite of best-in-class Cloud Native devtools on your machine including [Cloud SDK](https://cloud.google.com/sdk), [Kubectl](https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/kubectl/kubectl/), [Minikube](https://minikube.sigs.k8s.io/docs/), and [Skaffold](https://skaffold.dev/)."},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.cloudStorageExplorer","when":"!gcloudInstalling && !authLoggedIn","contents":"Please login to Google Cloud to continue. If you don't have an account yet, you can get started with a [free trial](https://cloud.google.com/free).\n[Login to Google Cloud](command:cloudcode.gke.runGcloudAuth)"},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.cloudStorageExplorer","when":"authLoggedIn && !authProjectId","contents":"Please select a Google Cloud project continue. If you don't have a project yet, you can create one in [Cloud Console](https://console.cloud.google.com/projectcreate).\n[Select a project](command:cloudcode.sharedExplorer.chooseProject)"},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.cloudStorageExplorer","when":"authLoggedIn && !authProjectId && !runningOnCloudShell","contents":"If you want to select a project in another account, you can [sign out](command:cloudcode.gke.gcloudSignout) and sign back in."},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.kubectlExplorer","when":"!gcloudComponentsInstalling","contents":"Get started with Kubernetes in Cloud Code by adding a cluster to your KubeConfig. Clicking the button below is a good place to start, even if you don't have a cluster already.\n[Add a cluster to the KubeConfig](command:cloudcode.addClusterToConfig)\nAlternatively, if you already have a KubeConfig file, you can [load the file](command:cloudcode.switchKubeConfig)."},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.kubernetes.localDevExplorer","when":"!gcloudComponentsInstalling","contents":"Run or debug your kubernetes app using the options in the title bar or the options below.\n[Create a Kubernetes sample](command:cloudcode.createK8sAppExplorerTitle)\n[Run on Kubernetes](command:cloudcode.runK8sAppExplorerTitle)\n[Debug on Kubernetes](command:cloudcode.debugK8sAppExplorerTitle)"},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.mcdcSources","when":"isRunOnLinux && !m2cToolsInstalled","contents":"Replatform applications to containers on GKE.\n[Install tools](command:cloudcode.migrateToContainers.installTools)\n[Edit tools paths](command:cloudcode.migrateToContainers.editToolsPaths)"},{"view":"cloudcode.unified.mcdcSources","when":"isRunOnLinux && m2cToolsInstalled","contents":"Replatform applications to containers on GKE.\n[Edit Sources](command:cloudcode.migrateToContainers.mcdc.editSources)"}],"views":{"1-cloudCodeContainer":[{"id":"cloudcode.unified.kubernetes.localDevExplorer","name":"Development Sessions","icon":"images/kubernetes_logo.svg","visibility":"collapsed"},{"id":"cloudcode.unified.kubectlExplorer","name":"Kubernetes","icon":"images/kubernetes_logo.svg","visibility":"collapsed"},{"id":"cloudcode.unified.cloudRunExplorer","name":"Cloud Run","icon":"images/cloud_run_logo.svg","visibility":"collapsed"},{"id":"cloudcode.unified.apiExplorer","name":"Cloud APIs","icon":"images/cloud_api_logo.svg","visibility":"collapsed"},{"id":"cloudcode.unified.gcsExplorer","name":"Cloud Storage","icon":"images/google_cloud.svg","when":"config.cloudcode.beta.enableGcsExplorer","visibility":"collapsed"},{"id":"cloudcode.unified.dataprocExplorer","name":"Dataproc","icon":"images/dataproc_logo.svg","when":"config.cloudcode.beta.enableBigqueryExplorer","visibility":"collapsed"},{"id":"cloudcode.unified.notebookExplorer","name":"Notebooks","icon":"images/notebook_template_icon.svg","when":"config.cloudcode.beta.enableBigqueryExplorer","visibility":"collapsed"},{"id":"cloudcode.unified.bigQueryDatasetExplorer","name":"BigQuery Datasets","icon":"images/google_cloud.svg","when":"config.cloudcode.beta.enableBigqueryExplorer","visibility":"collapsed"},{"id":"cloudcode.unified.secretsExplorer","name":"Secret Manager","icon":"images/secrets_logo.svg","visibility":"collapsed"},{"id":"cloudcode.unified.gceExplorer","name":"Compute Engine","visibility":"collapsed"},{"id":"cloudcode.unified.apigee.explorer","name":"Apigee","icon":"images/Apigee.svg","visibility":"collapsed"},{"id":"cloudcode.unified.gcfExplorer","name":"Cloud Functions","icon":"images/functions_logo.svg","visibility":"collapsed"},{"id":"cloudcode.unified.cloudStorageExplorer","name":"Cloud Storage","when":"config.cloudcode.beta.enableCloudStorage","visibility":"collapsed"},{"id":"cloudcode.unified.mcdcSources","name":"Replatform Apps","contextualTitle":"Replatform Apps","when":"isRunOnLinux","visibility":"collapsed"},{"id":"cloudcode.helpAndFeedbackExplorer","name":"Help and Feedback"}]},"snippets":[{"language":"xml","path":"./snippets/apigee/flow-elements.json"},{"language":"xml","path":"./snippets/apigee/runtime-variables.json"}]},"devDependencies":{},"dependencies":{},"repository":{"type":"git","url":"https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-code-vscode.git"},"bugs":{"url":"https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-code-vscode/issues"}},"location":{"$mid":1,"path":"/c:/Users/bills/.vscode/extensions/googlecloudtools.cloudcode-2.37.0","scheme":"file"},"isBuiltin":false,"targetPlatform":"undefined","publisherDisplayName":"Google Cloud","metadata":{"isApplicationScoped":false,"isMachineScoped":false,"isBuiltin":false,"installedTimestamp":1761001848490,"pinned":false,"source":"gallery","id":"5e8803a2-3dc8-42b3-9c5f-ea9d37828c03","publisherId":"f24fd523-af08-49d8-bb0b-f4eda502706e","publisherDisplayName":"Google Cloud","targetPlatform":"undefined","updated":true,"private":false,"isPreReleaseVersion":false,"hasPreReleaseVersion":false,"preRelease":false,"size":297332028},"isValid":true,"validations":[],"preRelease":false},{"type":1,"identifier":{"id":"ms-toolsai.jupyter","uuid":"6c2f1801-1e7f-45b2-9b5c-7782f1e076e8"},"manifest":{"name":"jupyter","displayName":"Jupyter","version":"2025.9.1","description":"Jupyter notebook support, interactive programming and computing that supports Intellisense, debugging and more.","publisher":"ms-toolsai","author":{"name":"Microsoft Corporation"},"extensionPack":["ms-toolsai.jupyter-keymap","ms-toolsai.jupyter-renderers","ms-toolsai.vscode-jupyter-slideshow","ms-toolsai.vscode-jupyter-cell-tags"],"license":"MIT","homepage":"https://github.com/Microsoft/vscode-jupyter","repository":{"type":"git","url":"https://github.com/Microsoft/vscode-jupyter"},"bugs":{"url":"https://github.com/Microsoft/vscode-jupyter/issues"},"qna":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-jupyter/discussions","icon":"icon.png","galleryBanner":{"color":"#ffffff","theme":"light"},"engines":{"vscode":"^1.105.0"},"l10n":"./l10n","extensionKind":["workspace"],"keywords":["jupyter","notebook","notebookKernelJupyterNotebook","multi-root ready","python","interactive"],"categories":["Extension Packs","Data Science","Machine Learning","Notebooks","Visualization"],"activationEvents":["onLanguage:python","onLanguage:jupyter","onNotebook:jupyter-notebook","onNotebook:interactive","onWebviewPanel:jupyter-variables","onWebviewPanel:jupyter","onLanguageModelTool:configure_notebook","onLanguageModelTool:notebook_list_packages","onLanguageModelTool:notebook_install_packages"],"main":"./dist/extension.node.proxy.js","capabilities":{"virtualWorkspaces":true,"untrustedWorkspaces":{"supported":"limited","description":"Execution of cells in Interactive Window and Notebooks is not supported in untrusted workspaces."}},"contributes":{"walkthroughs":[{"id":"jupyterWelcome","title":"Get Started with Jupyter Notebooks","description":"Your first steps to set up a Jupyter project with all the powerful tools and features that the Jupyter Extension has to offer!","when":"workspacePlatform != webworker","steps":[{"id":"ipynb.newUntitledIpynb","title":"Create or open a Jupyter Notebook","description":"Right-click in the file explorer and create a new file with an .ipynb extension. Or, open the [Command Palette](command:workbench.action.showCommands) and run the command \n``Create: New Jupyter Notebook``.\n[Create New Jupyter Notebook](command:toSide:ipynb.newUntitledIpynb)\n If you have an existing project, you can also [open a folder](command:toSide:workbench.action.files.openFolder) and/or clone a project from GitHub: [clone a Git repository](command:toSide:git.clone).","media":{"svg":"resources/walkthroughs/opennotebook.svg","altText":"Creating a new Jupyter notebook"},"completionEvents":["onCommand:ipynb.newUntitledIpynb","onCommand:jupyter.createnewinteractive","onCommand:workbench.action.files.openFolder","onCommand:workbench.action.files.openFileFolder"]},{"id":"jupyter.selectKernel","title":"Select a Jupyter Kernel","description":"Click Select Kernel at the top right of the notebook and choose the environment in which to run your kernel. Or, with a notebook opened and in focus, open the [Command Palette](command:workbench.action.showCommands) and run the command: \n``Notebook: Select Notebook Kernel``. \n[Open Command Palette to Select a Jupyter Kernel](command:workbench.action.showCommands)","media":{"svg":"resources/walkthroughs/kernel.svg","altText":"Selecting or changing a notebook kernel"},"completionEvents":["onCommand:notebook.selectKernel"]},{"id":"jupyter.exploreAndDebug","title":"Explore data and debug","description":"📅 You can use the [Data Viewer](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/datascience/data-science-tutorial#_prepare-the-data) to view, sort, and filter the rows of data. After loading your data, click \"Variables\" at the top right of the notebook and click the Data Viewer icon to the left of the data table. \n \n[Learn about Data Viewer](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/datascience/data-science-tutorial#_prepare-the-data)\n \n📒 Debug your notebook using the [Run by Line](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/datascience/jupyter-notebooks#_run-by-line) mode to execute a cell one line at a time. Click the Run by Line icon from your cell (play button with lines) or hit F10. \n \n[Learn about Run by Line](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/datascience/jupyter-notebooks#_run-by-line)","media":{"svg":"resources/walkthroughs/data.svg","altText":"Opening data viewer"}},{"id":"jupyter.dataScienceLearnMore","title":"Find out more!","description":"🎨 Explore all the features the Jupyter Extension has to offer by looking for \"Jupyter\" in the [Command Palette](command:workbench.action.showCommands). \n 📈 Learn more about getting started with data science in [Python](command:workbench.action.openWalkthrough?%7B%22category%22%3A%22ms-python.python%23pythonDataScienceWelcome%22%2C%22step%22%3A%22ms-python.python%23python.createNewNotebook%22%7D) by installing the Python Extension ([search Python extension](command:workbench.extensions.search?\"ms-python.python\")). \n 📃 Find out more features in our [Tutorials](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/datascience/jupyter-notebooks).  \n[Learn more](https://aka.ms/AAdar6q)","media":{"svg":"resources/walkthroughs/learnmore.svg","altText":"Image representing our documentation page and mailing list resources."}}]}],"keybindings":[{"command":"jupyter.execSelectionInteractive","key":"shift+enter","when":"editorTextFocus && editorLangId == python && !findInputFocussed && !replaceInputFocussed && jupyter.ownsSelection && !notebookEditorFocused && !isCompositeNotebook"},{"command":"jupyter.runcurrentcelladvance","key":"shift+enter","when":"editorTextFocus && !editorHasSelection && jupyter.hascodecells && !notebookEditorFocused && !isCompositeNotebook"},{"command":"jupyter.runcurrentcell","key":"ctrl+enter","when":"editorTextFocus && !editorHasSelection && jupyter.hascodecells && !notebookEditorFocused && !isCompositeNotebook"},{"command":"jupyter.runcurrentcellandaddbelow","key":"alt+enter","when":"editorTextFocus && !editorHasSelection && jupyter.hascodecells && !notebookEditorFocused"},{"key":"escape","when":"isCompositeNotebook && !editorHoverVisible && !suggestWidgetVisible && !isComposing && !inSnippetMode && !exceptionWidgetVisible && !selectionAnchorSet && !LinkedEditingInputVisible && !renameInputVisible && !editorHasSelection && !accessibilityHelpWidgetVisible && !breakpointWidgetVisible && !findWidgetVisible && !markersNavigationVisible && !parameterHintsVisible && !editorHasMultipleSelections && !notificationToastsVisible && !notebookEditorFocused && !inlineChatVisible","command":"interactive.input.clear"},{"command":"jupyte